step	1	-	Quick guide step 1
line	<col=000080>Talk to <col=800000>Ava</col> in the west wing of <col=800000>Draynor Manor</col> and complete the dialogue.</col>
step	2	-	Quick guide step 2
line	<str>Talk to Ava in the west wing of Draynor Manor and complete the dialogue.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Go to the <col=800000>undead chicken</col> farm west of the <col=800000>Ectofuntus</col> with your <col=800000>ghostspeak amulet</col> and <col=800000>ecto-token</col>s (or materials for them), and talk to <col=800000>Alice</col>.</col>
step	3	-	Quick guide step 3
line	<str>Talk to Ava in the west wing of Draynor Manor and complete the dialogue.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to the undead chicken farm west of the Ectofuntus with your ghostspeak amulet and ecto-tokens (or materials for them), and talk to Alice.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Keep talking between Alice and <col=800000>Malcolm</col> in the cow pen 4 times until she tells you to go to talk to the <col=800000>old crone</col> for an amulet.</col>
step	4	-	Quick guide step 4
line	<str>Talk to Ava in the west wing of Draynor Manor and complete the dialogue.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to the undead chicken farm west of the Ectofuntus with your ghostspeak amulet and ecto-tokens (or materials for them), and talk to Alice.</str>
line	
line	<str>Keep talking between Alice and Malcolm in the cow pen 4 times until she tells you to go to talk to the old crone for an amulet.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Run west of the farm until you reach the old crone's house just east of the <col=800000>Slayer Tower</col>.</col>
