line	<str>Take the selected iron to the centre of the Rimmington mine, face north, and use the hammer on it.</str>
line	
line	<str>Return to Ava and give her the magnet.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Ava.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use your axe on an Undead tree (not Dead tree) in front of the Manor (yellow examine).</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Turael, the Slayer master in a house in south-eastern Burthorpe.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Turael again to receive the Blessed axe, provided you have a Mithril axe and a Holy symbol in your inventory.</str>
line	
line	<str>Return to the mansion and cut the undead tree again.</str>
line	
line	<str>Bring the Undead twigs to Ava.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Ava again, and she will give you garbled research notes that you need to solve.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Talk to Ava again.</col>
